## Managed by SystemConfigs (configs/system/ssh/). Symlinked to ~/.ssh/config.
## Per-host blocks are symlinked into ~/.ssh/config.d/ per the active profile's `ssh_hosts`.
## Global `Host *` defaults live in config.d/zz-defaults.conf, included last on purpose:
## ssh takes the first value it sees for most keywords, so per-host blocks win.

Include ~/.ssh/config.d/*.conf
